[{"id":"seytek-2012:p1126:b003:l024","ordinal":381185,"en":"And thrust forth his spear,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1126:b003:l025","ordinal":381186,"en":"His skill surpassing all measure."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1126:b003:l026","ordinal":381187,"en":"When he saw that sign,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1126:b003:l027","ordinal":381188,"en":"He truly perceived the worth and stature"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1126:b003:l028","ordinal":381189,"en":"Of Joltoy, who boasted of valor;"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1126:b003:l029","ordinal":381190,"en":"Now, damn it,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1126:b003:l030","ordinal":381191,"en":"Chonbilgich’s confidence deserted him."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1126:b003:l031","ordinal":381192,"en":"“God forbid we see his face!"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1126:b003:l032","ordinal":381193,"en":"What will the meaning of this be?"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1126:b003:l033","ordinal":381194,"en":"His figure and noble bearing,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1126:b003:l034","ordinal":381195,"en":"His heroic appearance—"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1126:b003:l035","ordinal":381196,"en":"He will strike down anyone who faces him."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1126:b003:l036","ordinal":381197,"en":"He will suck them in like Black Mardai"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1126:b003:l037","ordinal":381198,"en":"And devour countless lives.”"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1126:b003:l038","ordinal":381199,"en":"Chonbilgich was keen-sighted;"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1126:b003:l039","ordinal":381200,"en":"He truly was a great knower,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1126:b003:l040","ordinal":381201,"en":"Even in death his words were clear,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1127:b002:l001","ordinal":381202,"en":"And in life his eyes were open."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1127:b002:l002","ordinal":381203,"en":"Bilgich was famed among men,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1127:b002:l003","ordinal":381204,"en":"A peerless judge and seer."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1127:b002:l004","ordinal":381205,"en":"He watched Joltoy warily,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1127:b002:l005","ordinal":381206,"en":"Knowing that the tiger Joltoy"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1127:b002:l006","ordinal":381207,"en":"Had the valor to crush"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1127:b002:l007","ordinal":381208,"en":"Whomever he encountered."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1127:b002:l008","ordinal":381209,"en":"“Ah, Joltoy is a true hero,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1127:b002:l009","ordinal":381210,"en":"Standing proud and pouring out his wrath;"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1127:b002:l010","ordinal":381211,"en":"The hour has come to face his foes.”"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1127:b002:l011","ordinal":381212,"en":"So saying, Chonbilgich"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1127:b002:l012","ordinal":381213,"en":"Spoke thus to his retainers,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1127:b002:l013","ordinal":381214,"en":"Warning them to tend the horses,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1127:b002:l014","ordinal":381215,"en":"And never surrender their honor"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1127:b002:l015","ordinal":381216,"en":"Until their noble heads entered the earth:"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1127:b002:l016","ordinal":381217,"en":"“He who has no honor has no shame;"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1127:b002:l017","ordinal":381218,"en":"The Burut nation is your foe."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1127:b002:l018","ordinal":381219,"en":"We came stalking from the Kakan"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1127:b002:l019","ordinal":381220,"en":"To humble the Kyrgyz spirit"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1127:b002:l020","ordinal":381221,"en":"And open the road for China."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1127:b002:l021","ordinal":381222,"en":"Do not twitch in irritation;"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1127:b002:l022","ordinal":381223,"en":"My warriors, do not stir.”"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1127:b002:l023","ordinal":381224,"en":"He said this to his comrades,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1127:b002:l024","ordinal":381225,"en":"Then charged the fearsome Joltoy,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1127:b002:l025","ordinal":381226,"en":"Prepared to die if death had come,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1127:b002:l026","ordinal":381227,"en":"For honor and for his people,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1127:b002:l027","ordinal":381228,"en":"And to answer Joltoy."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1127:b002:l028","ordinal":381229,"en":"Raging, he rushed forward,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1127:b002:l029","ordinal":381230,"en":"And there they clashed."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1127:b002:l030","ordinal":381231,"en":"Akjoltoy was his opponent,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1127:b002:l031","ordinal":381232,"en":"A matchless champion like Mount Kap;"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1127:b002:l032","ordinal":381233,"en":"Without fluster or concern,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1127:b002:l033","ordinal":381234,"en":"Even if not Bilgich alone but all Beijing"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1127:b002:l034","ordinal":381235,"en":"Shouted and leveled their spears,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1127:b002:l035","ordinal":381236,"en":"He would not reckon them equal to his boot-tip."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1127:b002:l036","ordinal":381237,"en":"His tiger nature showed;"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1127:b002:l037","ordinal":381238,"en":"When he saw Chonbilgich,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1127:b002:l038","ordinal":381239,"en":"He laughed in eager delight."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1127:b002:l039","ordinal":381240,"en":"Without fuss, Akjoltoy"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1127:b002:l040","ordinal":381241,"en":"Fought with measured force—"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1127:b003:l001","ordinal":381242,"en":"Who had ever seen such a deed?"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1127:b003:l002","ordinal":381243,"en":"The mountain-like steed Külansur"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1127:b003:l003","ordinal":381244,"en":"Halted and turned its head."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1127:b003:l004","ordinal":381245,"en":"Your Joltoy, who came alone from the host,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1127:b003:l005","ordinal":381246,"en":"Reached the feather-grass plain;"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1127:b003:l006","ordinal":381247,"en":"No dust rose beneath him"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1127:b003:l007","ordinal":381248,"en":"Where the earth itself seemed to speak,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1127:b003:l008","ordinal":381249,"en":"And now the mountain-like Külansur"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1127:b003:l009","ordinal":381250,"en":"Was reined in and turned."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1127:b003:l010","ordinal":381251,"en":"Rejoicing at the word “foe,”"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1127:b003:l011","ordinal":381252,"en":"Clad entirely in iron,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1127:b003:l012","ordinal":381253,"en":"He chose a steel-tipped spear,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1127:b003:l013","ordinal":381254,"en":"And girded on his naked sword."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1127:b003:l014","ordinal":381255,"en":"Wearing ninety robes of silk,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1127:b003:l015","ordinal":381256,"en":"Hero Joltoy said, “I trust in fate.”"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1127:b003:l016","ordinal":381257,"en":"Hero Bilgich was huge as a mountain,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1127:b003:l017","ordinal":381258,"en":"A fortress sprung from Beijing,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1127:b003:l018","ordinal":381259,"en":"A hero of immeasurable might."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1127:b003:l019","ordinal":381260,"en":"Ninety beasts were slaughtered at his feast;"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1127:b003:l020","ordinal":381261,"en":"Orphaned of his father at six months,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1127:b003:l021","ordinal":381262,"en":"He was given the name Bilgich."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1127:b003:l022","ordinal":381263,"en":"He had slain head-shaking giants,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1127:b003:l023","ordinal":381264,"en":"And crushed armies on the march,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1127:b003:l024","ordinal":381265,"en":"Proving the lion in his valor;"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1127:b003:l025","ordinal":381266,"en":"Throughout Beijing, he brought the lands"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1127:b003:l026","ordinal":381267,"en":"Of forty khans beneath a single will."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1127:b003:l027","ordinal":381268,"en":"He became master of Kakanchin"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1127:b003:l028","ordinal":381269,"en":"And a giant to the whole world."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1127:b003:l029","ordinal":381270,"en":"His menace was one thing, his venom fierce;"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1127:b003:l030","ordinal":381271,"en":"When he roared, even a dark-hearted man"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1127:b003:l031","ordinal":381272,"en":"Despaired of life, crying, “I am dead!”"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1127:b003:l032","ordinal":381273,"en":"His mustache bristled hair by hair,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1127:b003:l033","ordinal":381274,"en":"His many peoples gathered in one place."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1127:b003:l034","ordinal":381275,"en":"Here was courage, here was the lion;"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1127:b003:l035","ordinal":381276,"en":"Akjoltoy was his opponent,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1127:b003:l036","ordinal":381277,"en":"And this was where Bilgich had come."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1127:b003:l037","ordinal":381278,"en":"When he saw the hero Akjoltoy,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1127:b003:l038","ordinal":381279,"en":"He began a savage quarrel,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1127:b003:l039","ordinal":381280,"en":"Raging and roaring,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1127:b003:l040","ordinal":381281,"en":"As though to crush heaven and earth,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1128:b002:l001","ordinal":381282,"en":"And anyone who witnessed his fury"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1128:b002:l002","ordinal":381283,"en":"Was left feeling swallowed whole."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1128:b002:l003","ordinal":381284,"en":"He roared in menace,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1128:b002:l004","ordinal":381285,"en":"Like the lion of the divided mountains,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1128:b002:l005","ordinal":381286,"en":"Bellowing like a lion."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1128:b002:l006","ordinal":381287,"en":"He struck the royal war drum,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1128:b002:l007","ordinal":381288,"en":"Sounding the signal,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1128:b002:l008","ordinal":381289,"en":"Then whipped his great rhinoceros mount"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1128:b002:l009","ordinal":381290,"en":"And rode out onto the battlefield."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1128:b002:l010","ordinal":381291,"en":"“Akjoltoy of the Kyrgyz,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1128:b002:l011","ordinal":381292,"en":"Your tongue speaks a babbling speech;"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1128:b002:l012","ordinal":381293,"en":"In your heart, you are my enemy."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1128:b002:l013","ordinal":381294,"en":"If my strength fails and leaves me,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1128:b002:l014","ordinal":381295,"en":"I shall meet my death at your hands;"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1128:b002:l015","ordinal":381296,"en":"But if my strength is enough,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1128:b002:l016","ordinal":381297,"en":"I shall hew your borders into countless pieces."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1128:b002:l017","ordinal":381298,"en":"If I fight in wrath,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1128:b002:l018","ordinal":381299,"en":"I shall scatter your honor like ashes;"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1128:b002:l019","ordinal":381300,"en":"And if rage seizes me again,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1128:b002:l020","ordinal":381301,"en":"I shall rip apart your ribs."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1128:b002:l021","ordinal":381302,"en":"If my strength fails and leaves me,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1128:b002:l022","ordinal":381303,"en":"I shall depart this world;"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1128:b002:l023","ordinal":381304,"en":"But I shall tell Jadygoy,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1128:b002:l024","ordinal":381305,"en":"‘I came and destroyed the Buruts,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1128:b002:l025","ordinal":381306,"en":"And delivered the punishment"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1128:b002:l026","ordinal":381307,"en":"Of all the black Kyrgyz into his hands.’"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1128:b002:l027","ordinal":381308,"en":"I shall ride to Kakanchin, saying,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1128:b002:l028","ordinal":381309,"en":"‘I slaughtered the Buruts.’"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1128:b002:l029","ordinal":381310,"en":"When my wild rage seizes me—"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1128:b002:l030","ordinal":381311,"en":"And now my fury has risen—"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1128:b002:l031","ordinal":381312,"en":"You mother-forsaken wretched Burut,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1128:b002:l032","ordinal":381313,"en":"I shall awaken your ancient madness."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1128:b002:l033","ordinal":381314,"en":"Let one of you come, or let a thousand come;"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1128:b002:l034","ordinal":381315,"en":"You snarling madmen,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1128:b002:l035","ordinal":381316,"en":"Let all your strongest heroes come."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1128:b002:l036","ordinal":381317,"en":"If I flinch, can I ever recover?"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1128:b002:l037","ordinal":381318,"en":"My forefather was a mighty lord;"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1128:b002:l038","ordinal":381319,"en":"I have come stalking from afar."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1128:b002:l039","ordinal":381320,"en":"If I quail, am I even a man?"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1128:b002:l040","ordinal":381321,"en":"You shall behold my great calamity."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1128:b003:l001","ordinal":381322,"en":"You are not alone, Joltoy;"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1128:b003:l002","ordinal":381323,"en":"All you Buruts together shall die!"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1128:b003:l003","ordinal":381324,"en":"If I do not turn my thoroughbred"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1128:b003:l004","ordinal":381325,"en":"Onto the passes where you graze your herds,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1128:b003:l005","ordinal":381326,"en":"Onto the lands where your lineage multiplies,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1128:b003:l006","ordinal":381327,"en":"May I die unworthy of the name Bilgich;"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1128:b003:l007","ordinal":381328,"en":"If I do not slaughter a thousand of you at once,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1128:b003:l008","ordinal":381329,"en":"If I do not butcher your people before returning,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1128:b003:l009","ordinal":381330,"en":"Crushing and doubling over your backs,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1128:b003:l010","ordinal":381331,"en":"Plundering your Kyrgyz nation,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1128:b003:l011","ordinal":381332,"en":"Seating your tall sons at my hearthstones,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1128:b003:l012","ordinal":381333,"en":"And seizing your daughters as lawful booty,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1128:b003:l013","ordinal":381334,"en":"Binding your mighty men in the marsh,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1128:b003:l014","ordinal":381335,"en":"You damned Buruts,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1128:b003:l015","ordinal":381336,"en":"And boiling you in your misery;"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1128:b003:l016","ordinal":381337,"en":"If I do not tear by force"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1128:b003:l017","ordinal":381338,"en":"The robes from your backs,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1128:b003:l018","ordinal":381339,"en":"Strip away your worth,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1128:b003:l019","ordinal":381340,"en":"And bring your power to an end;"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1128:b003:l020","ordinal":381341,"en":"If I do not make your people wander"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1128:b003:l021","ordinal":381342,"en":"In uproar like victims of yellow fever;"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1128:b003:l022","ordinal":381343,"en":"If I do not bring ruin upon your blood,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1128:b003:l023","ordinal":381344,"en":"Destroying all who cross my path,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1128:b003:l024","ordinal":381345,"en":"And reducing them to utter silence;"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1128:b003:l025","ordinal":381346,"en":"If I do not thwart your desire,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1128:b003:l026","ordinal":381347,"en":"And heap boulders like Opol"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1128:b003:l027","ordinal":381348,"en":"Across the road where you roam at will,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1128:b003:l028","ordinal":381349,"en":"You accursed, wretched Kyrgyz;"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1128:b003:l029","ordinal":381350,"en":"If I do not crush your petty rage,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1128:b003:l030","ordinal":381351,"en":"Find a way to overcome you,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1128:b003:l031","ordinal":381352,"en":"Then turn back and raid your village,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1128:b003:l032","ordinal":381353,"en":"May I die unworthy of the name Bilgich,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1128:b003:l033","ordinal":381354,"en":"May I sink stillborn, never truly born."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1128:b003:l034","ordinal":381355,"en":"Through hardship and sorcerous learning,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1128:b003:l035","ordinal":381356,"en":"I became a hero who knew distant things;"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1128:b003:l036","ordinal":381357,"en":"I was lord over the lands of forty khans,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1128:b003:l037","ordinal":381358,"en":"The very embodiment of a noble hero.”"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1128:b003:l038","ordinal":381359,"en":"So saying, Chonbilgich"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1128:b003:l039","ordinal":381360,"en":"Gathered all his wrath"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1128:b003:l040","ordinal":381361,"en":"And would not rest without combat."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1129:b002:l001","ordinal":381362,"en":"The icon is broken."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1129:b002:l002","ordinal":381363,"en":"The soul of the beholder is crushed,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1129:b002:l003","ordinal":381364,"en":"The art form is like a fist,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1129:b002:l004","ordinal":381365,"en":"A buried pig,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1129:b002:l005","ordinal":381366,"en":"This is the most courageous."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1129:b002:l006","ordinal":381367,"en":"The underside is white"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1129:b002:l007","ordinal":381368,"en":"A large invisible tribe,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1129:b002:l008","ordinal":381369,"en":"And in your tribe,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1129:b002:l009","ordinal":381370,"en":"Looking in the black eyes"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1129:b002:l010","ordinal":381371,"en":"Not until he breaks his will,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1129:b002:l011","ordinal":381372,"en":"There is no marten-pierced shoulder."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1129:b002:l012","ordinal":381373,"en":"There is no weight like Saka,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1129:b002:l013","ordinal":381374,"en":"There is no obstacle."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1129:b002:l014","ordinal":381375,"en":"A roaring gray field"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1129:b002:l015","ordinal":381376,"en":"May the Creator fix his back,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1129:b002:l016","ordinal":381377,"en":"Big boy came from China."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1129:b002:l017","ordinal":381378,"en":"There is no blood from the angry,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1129:b002:l018","ordinal":381379,"en":"A runaway dog ​​will not survive."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1129:b002:l019","ordinal":381380,"en":"The danger is ahead -"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1129:b002:l020","ordinal":381381,"en":"Akzholtoy stopped."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1129:b002:l021","ordinal":381382,"en":"I have a lot of worries,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1129:b002:l022","ordinal":381383,"en":"It's time for a bad arc,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1129:b002:l023","ordinal":381384,"en":"Please, my God."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1129:b002:l024","ordinal":381385,"en":"See for yourself,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1129:b002:l025","ordinal":381386,"en":"From the wrath that represents,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1129:b002:l026","ordinal":381387,"en":"From the dragon's fury,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1129:b002:l027","ordinal":381388,"en":"The people are disbelievers"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1129:b002:l028","ordinal":381389,"en":"Evil intent is narrow,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1129:b002:l029","ordinal":381390,"en":"From the evil knower infidel,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1129:b002:l030","ordinal":381391,"en":"Help yourself, the Creator,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1129:b002:l031","ordinal":381392,"en":"Be a friend to the general public."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1129:b002:l032","ordinal":381393,"en":"The ghost of my departed grandfather"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1129:b002:l033","ordinal":381394,"en":"Please come and support us."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1129:b002:l034","ordinal":381395,"en":"He stood motionless."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1129:b002:l035","ordinal":381396,"en":"Kulunsur below"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1129:b002:l036","ordinal":381397,"en":"Kulunsur turned his mouth now."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1129:b002:l037","ordinal":381398,"en":"Moon, animal Kulunsur"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1129:b002:l038","ordinal":381399,"en":"Like an old man"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1129:b002:l039","ordinal":381400,"en":"Birth is like a trap,"},{"id":"seytek-20